    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "coping mechanisms just feel like more work. more things to manage, more things to keep track of. it's all just more noise. i just want everything to be quiet. i just want to stop feeling like i have to carry this version of me around. there's just no way to actually get rest when you're this hollowed out.",
